  covers: F-11
  cases:
    - query returns vars and rows, and reports truncation
    - a malformed query is a tool failure carrying the message
    - boundQuery caps a query at the engine
    - ask answers a boolean
    - vocabulary lists asserted and derived terms with the namespace prefixes
    - describe resolves a path and shows both directions
    - describe resolves package names and prefixed IRIs
    - an ambiguous name lists candidates instead of choosing one
    - files filters by prefix and language
    - stats counts files, quads and derived graphs
